# GW2 API key, needed only by the account/ tools (account.window, account.snapshot).
# Make one at https://account.arena.net/applications with these scopes:
#   account, wallet, inventories, characters, tradingpost
# account.window needs just account + tradingpost; the rest are for the full
# account valuation in account.snapshot. The key is read-only and never printed.
# The price collector uses public endpoints and needs no key.
GW2_API_KEY=
